      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后大家都热心指点我！\n所以才能做出卡路里低，\n蛋白质丰富的美味便当！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72bbc130e22471ca7401c3ff620abe318967fbd57b71137c216080880e194a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
