      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d9293cf058045cf654f7d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对了！　为了庆祝减肥成功，\n我来做点大餐吧！\n训练员想吃什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a54e71e34640b5871df73de856100eba285c87ff0512b8145e1806e3cf751d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0008/storytimeline_400008322.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d73ffef963593ecd418e550a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这么问我，稍微想了想――我还是跟她说，\n想吃之前的低卡便当。",
      "source_fingerprint": "221c4978a418f737b8c1163413bea43964c4c766dded06cf98d2deab6334cdcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0008/storytimeline_400008322.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:281cf1ac7b4b735a194ffb72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2006eb90c4483cd2444ac5e7378edb673044470d41a5dd967aaabbc498929a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0008/storytimeline_400008322.json",
      "json_path": [
